{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=crime",{"Nothing to report","Business as usual, mostly","The boss won't like this, but it's not my problem","Nobody was ever here","Don't talk to anyone about this","Good, you're on time, the meeting's in an hour","Stay quiet and out of sight, I ain't wasting rounds on another mess","You hear anything about the outfit's trucks? Nothing? Good","Pleasure doing no business with you","Everything's fine, nothing's wrong, move along","Don't mention the boss's name, especially now","The books are fine, the world's not","Keep it clean, we've got an image","Meeting's at the usual place, bring nothing","Quiet's good for business, so, stay quiet","Don't speak the name aloud, we're not in the usual place","Everything's under control, I mean that, under control","Do the books balance? No? Nothing balances anymore","Boss wants the books by tomorrow, don't ask why","Don't talk shop in the open, people listen","Haven't heard from the others today. Don't know what to make of it","Who's collecting this week? Not me, I did last time","Don't look surprised, nobody's watching us","We take the long way, always, it's habit","Smile, nod, don't say a word, we're just two friends walking","Anybody asks, we're from the county, understood?"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=crime|mood=calm",{"Quiet day, the way I like it"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=crime|mood=funny",{"Good day for a walk, no questions asked"}},
