{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=crime|st=hostile",{"Nothing to see here, go on","Not your business","Not our business, go on"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=prison",{"You see anybody? No? Good","Don't tell nobody you saw me","Got a smoke? I'd trade anything","I ain't going back, no way","Don't look at the guards, if there are any","You hear sirens? I keep hearing sirens","Anybody got shoes in my size? I'm barefoot, almost","You okay? You look like you saw a ghost","Hey, we're out, we made it, can you believe it?","Anybody following us? Check, please, check","Don't talk loud, the guards might still be around","You got a spare shirt? Mine says county on it","Keep walking, nobody's following, nobody","I wish I'd stayed inside, at least it was safe","Don't look back, I mean, don't, just don't","Don't look so scared, I'm just walking","You see any dogs? I hate dogs","You been inside? You've got the look, don't deny it","I'm never going back, you hear? Never","Did anybody bring cigarettes? Anybody?","Keep your sleeves down, they spot the tattoos","Count's wrong again, it's always wrong","The yard's behind us now, that's something","Don't run, running makes them chase","Walk like you belong, like you've got somewhere to be","Somebody hungry? I found a vending machine, still full"}},
