{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=5,10",{"Morning","Morning, you sleep at all?","Mornin', you look half dead, same as me","Early start, huh?","Morning, got any coffee? No? Same","Sun's up, let's get moving","Morning, did you hear anything overnight?","Hey, morning. How's your mama and them?","Morning, you headed to the church? They've got oatmeal","Hello, good morning, what's left of it","Rise and shine, ha, I never could say that with a straight face"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|hour=5,10",{"Morning. We made it through another night, thank God","Hi, good morning, is it still bad out there?"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|hour=5,10",{"Morning, same as yesterday, I take it?","Morning, I'd say have a good one, but you know"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=11,13",{"Hey, noon already? Where's the day go","You folks eaten? We've got some crackers","Midday, if you're looking for shade, there's a porch up there","Lunch? Ha, there's no lunch, there's just crackers","Hot sun and no water, that's a day for you, hello"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=13,17",{"Afternoon","Afternoon, you headed home?","Long day, huh? Sit down if you can","Afternoon, anything new?","Afternoon, better find a place before dark","Afternoon, you folks need anything? We've got a little","Afternoon, don't mind the dogs, they just want company"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|hour=13,17",{"Oh, afternoon, hi, I didn't see you there, sorry"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=17,20",{"Evening","Evening, you got somewhere to sleep?","Getting dark, find a place, we're going in","Evening, you look tired, go rest","Supper's cold beans again, join us if you want","Hey, evening, we're going to the church for the night, you coming?","Sun's going down, you don't want to be out here","Sun's low, we've got to find a place, any place","Dusk is when they get restless, I read that somewhere"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=17,20|world=road",{"Evening, folks, careful on the road, it's almost dark"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|hour=21,4",{"Shh, quiet, they hear everything at night","Who's there? Oh, it's just you, hi","Night walk? Brave, or stupid","Can't sleep either? Same","Keep it low, I can't see anything out here","Hey, got a light? Not a flashlight, I mean for a cigarette","Moon's bright, so keep to the shadows","Don't use a lantern, they see it for miles","The stars are out so thick now, with no lights","The dark's got a sound if you listen, and not a nice one"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|hour=21,4",{"Late for a stroll, ain't it? Sleep when you can","Night's the worst, so, good luck"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat,military,elite|hour=5,10",{"Morning, anything overnight?","Morning, report?","Dawn patrol's back, nothing to report","Morning, all quiet on your end?"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat,military,elite|hour=13,17",{"Afternoon, any trouble?","Afternoon, how's the east side?","Afternoon, still no word from base"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat,military,elite|hour=17,20",{"Evening, you've got the night watch? I'm off","Evening, curfew's in an hour, spread the word","Getting dark, so eyes up"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat,military,elite|hour=21,4",{"Night watch, quiet so far","Keep your light low, we're on night patrol","Anything moving out there? I thought I saw something","Long night, huh? Sleep if you can"}},
