{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=hot",{"It's so damn hot, I think I'm melting","You got any water? Warm's fine, I'm dying","My shirt's glued to me, I hate summer","Hot enough? Sorry, I always wanted to say that","Don't stay out in this, find some shade","Everybody's cranky in this heat, so, if I snap, I'm sorry","Ninety degrees, and we're walking, God help us","This heat's making me see things, tell me you see that too","Is there a stream anywhere? I'd drink anything at all"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|world=hot",{"Is it just me or is it getting hotter? I'm dizzy"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat,military,elite|world=hot",{"Drink something, that's an order, heat kills","Hot as hell, and the vests don't help","Heat's the real enemy today, drink up"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|world=hot",{"Hot as hell and twice as dumb, being out here","So fucking hot, I'd trade my gun for a fan"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=rain",{"Rain, again, of course it's raining","Come under here, I won't bite","Rain covers the noise, small mercies","My boots are full of water, every step squishes","You two look like drowned rats, hello","Rain's making my knees ache, how're yours?"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat,military,elite|world=rain",{"Rain's making everyone jumpy, stay alert","Mud's up to my ankles, but we hold"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat,military,elite|world=rain,road",{"Wet roads, slow down, nobody's in a hurry"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|world=rain",{"Soaked and mean, so don't talk to me","Rain's a good cover, so, move","Rain's slowing everybody down, good for us"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=cold",{"Cold enough for you? My fingers are dead","You got a coat? Any coat?"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=wind",{"Wind's carrying every smell and sound out here"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=fog",{"Can't see ten feet in this, watch where you're going","You walked out of the fog, hi, scared me"}},
