{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker",{"Hey, how's the crew?","Any of you got a spare wrench? Mine walked off","Hey. You find any gas? I'll trade you for it","You work at the plant? I thought I knew your face","Hell of a week, ain't it? Hell of a week","Hey, you guys seen the foreman? Nobody ever told me to go home","You guys heading to the lumberyard? They've got nails, I heard","Hey there, whatever time it is, I lost track","You alive? Good, that's all I needed to know","Don't go by the loading dock, it's a mess","Tell your folks I said hi, if you see them","Anybody over there fix trucks? Mine's in the ditch","Hey, got a smoke? I'll owe you one","You eat yet? I've got cold beans and a fork","Careful with that load, the straps are shot","Tough luck, huh? You get your pay before it all went to hell?","Union rep said something about this, but I wasn't listening","You hear the plant whistle? Thought I did, probably nothing","Heads up, I saw a few down by the tracks","Tell Dale I still have his drill, if he's alive, I mean","Hey, watch it with that, you'll take somebody's eye out","How long you been walking? I could use a lift, ha","Where do you folks find work boots anymore? Seriously","Y'all heading to the Marathon station? It's picked clean, don't bother","Do you know how to hotwire anything? Just curious","Hey, you work at the cannery? I thought I recognized you","Foreman said he'd pay us in cash, and then he died, so","Anybody got a pipe wrench? I've got a leak, a literal one","You fix engines? I've got a truck that won't turn over","I was a welder, and I've got nothing left to weld","Hey, you got a spare belt? Mine's falling apart","Is the plant still burning? Nobody's put it out","My hands are raw, my back's out, hello","I used to sell tractors, and now I'm wearing one's seat cushion as a hat","Didn't I work with you? At the sawmill, in March? The tall guy?","Anybody seen a guy in blue coveralls? He's my brother-in-law","Hey, you hear the whistle? The shift whistle? I'd bet it's still going","Hell of a quitting time, huh?","Hey, got any rope? A couple of feet will do","Did you see the guys at the loading dock? I'm looking for my crew","You boys know how to work a chainsaw? I've got one, no gas","Tell the foreman I quit, if you ever see him","Hey, you've got the look of somebody who knows tools, am I right?","Any luck finding work? Didn't think so","Smells like a fire at the mill, did you see?","Hey, my foot's got a nail in it, you got a clean rag?","You still got your CB? Anybody on channel nineteen?","I heard there's gas at the Sunoco on 31W, if you're desperate","Heard they hired on at the distillery, no more bourbon, though","Hey, my buddy Ray's in the next county, if you see him, say hi","Don't use the old bridge, the rail's rotted","We found a lathe in the shop, you can't eat it, but it's pretty","That's a good tool belt, mind if I look? Just curious","Anybody need a guy who can fix a refrigerator? Not that they work, but, skills","Shit, you startled me, I'm jumpy as a cat","Fuck, my back, fuck, I'm too old for this","Damn kids ran off with the lunch cooler, I hope they're eating well","Hell of a job, but at least nobody's yelling at me","Piss poor luck, finding this much nothing"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker|mood=funny",{"I'd say I'm having a good day, but nobody pays me to lie","You guys hiring? I'm unemployed and available"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker|mood=angry",{"I hate this, I hate all of this, hi, how are you"}},
