{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker|mood=calm",{"Nice and quiet, I like it"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker|day=0,4",{"Did you hear the plant closed? Did they tell you to go home too?","My buddy got bit at the loading dock, don't ask me about it","They're saying it's a virus, a virus, like the flu, I don't buy it","Heard the sirens? They've been going since Friday","Whatever you do, don't go near the guys on third shift","Stay out of the factory, it's bad in there"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned",{"Kept my lunch pail, funny thing to hold onto","Another day of this, you'd think I'd be used to it by now","Foreman's not coming, is he? I stopped waiting","Same shift, different dead guy","Never thought I'd miss writing up overtime","Anything left in the hardware store? I need a hammer and some nails","Whole crew I started with, I'm the last one, don't ask where they are","Ran into a guy with a forklift, you'd be amazed what that does","I've got a spare pair of work gloves, you look like you need them","I fixed the pump at the church, so now I'm the plumber","Everyone's got a job now, mine's keeping the lights on, which is funny","Nobody tells me what shift it is, so I'm on all of them"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker|st=careful",{"Easy, just passing through","Hands out in the open, same as mine"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=worker|st=hostile",{"Stay clear of my crew","Not this way"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=rescue",{"Hey, anybody hurt?","You all alright? You need anything?","We've got water at the station, if you're thirsty","Hi, we're from the fire station, don't be alarmed","Mind the glass, we just cleared it","Hello, any of you medical? We could use a hand","We're making rounds, so, don't worry, we're friendly","Are any of you bit? I need to ask everyone, sorry","There's a cot or two free at the station","Hi, we haven't slept. Still going","Hi, we're checking houses, have you seen anyone alive in there?","Hey, you carrying bandages? Anything sterile?","If you see anyone hurt, tell us, we'll come, I promise","We lost three of ours yesterday, so, if we seem short","Hey, you look like you could use some water, we've got a little","Hello. Anybody hurt? We've got bandages and water","You okay? You look pale, come sit down for a minute","Need bandages? I've got a few, they're not clean, but they're something","Hi, we're checking on people, is everyone alright over there?","Anybody seen a doctor? We've got a man with a bad cut","Where are you headed? We're looking for survivors, if you know of any","We've got room at the church, if you need it","Hello, I'm sorry to stop you, you wouldn't be a nurse, would you?","We've been to every house on Church Street, nobody's answered at the last three","Please, if you hear anything, tell us, we'll come running","Hello, folks, need medical? We're the volunteers","Please, anybody got a spare blanket? We've got a patient","Hi, we're on our way to the church, the wounded are there","Stay hydrated, folks, I'm saying it to everybody","You folks hurt? Burned? Sick? Just checking","If anyone's got a pulse, we want to talk to them, ha, that's a joke","Hey, got any spare gauze? We're out, and it's getting bad","We've got a roster of the dead, if you want to check a name","Everybody's welcome at the clinic, no questions","Do you know CPR? We could use another pair of hands","We've been up since Friday, so, if I'm slow, it's me, not you"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=rescue|mood=warm",{"Hey, good to see you, you're the first people today who smiled"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=rescue|mood=sad",{"Another group on foot, thank God, I thought we were the last..."}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=rescue|mood=grim",{"Don't go in the old mill, we found five there"}},
