{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=rescue|mood=funny",{"Good day for a house call, nobody's home, but still"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=rescue|day=0,4",{"Has anyone told you where to go? We don't even know ourselves","Stay together, don't wander, call us if somebody's hurt","We're running out of room at the station, but we'll find a spot"}},
