{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","role=rescue_firefighter",{"Engine's down at the station, if you need us, holler","Don't light anything, the whole block's dry as paper","Hoses all over the place here, mind your feet","Station's got a meal going, such as it is","Any smoke that way? We keep seeing it","Station's down the block, if you need a hand, we're there","If a house ever smells like gas, don't strike a match, just go","We lost the hose. I've got a bucket and a bad attitude","If you ever smell gas, don't light anything, just walk away","Hydrants are dead, so it's buckets, it's always buckets"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","role=rescue_medical",{"Anybody feverish? I'm checking everyone, please","Wash your hands, I know, I know, there's no water, do it anyway","I'm a nurse, if anyone's hurt, I'll look, quickly","Don't share cups, don't share canteens, I'm serious","Any of you sick? Don't hide it, we can help early","Anybody feverish? I'll check, it's quick, I promise","Drink something. You look dry as a bone","I can set a bone, if anyone needs, just ask","You look like you could use a checkup, quickly, may I?","Any coughing? Any fever? It matters, I promise","Anybody here know how to stitch? I've got a line of cuts","Have some water. Nurse asking, not your mother"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","role=rescue_clergy",{"Peace be with you, friends","God keep you on your way","We hold service in the church, all are welcome","I'll say a prayer for your journey, if you'd like","Pastor here, if you need to talk, my door's open","Peace to you and yours, whoever you are","I pray for everybody who passes, so you're in it","The Lord's with you, even if the world isn't","Pastor, from the church on the hill, you're welcome anytime","I'm sorry, I talk too much when I'm nervous, bless you","Walk in grace, both of you","God keep you, brother or sister, whoever you are","If you want to pray, I'm here, if not, I'm still here","The Lord's got a plan, they say, but He hasn't shared it with me","Pray with me for a minute? Not for me, for the people we lost","Welcome, welcome, the church is open, bring whoever"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","role=rescue_clergy|world=road",{"God keep you both, mind the road"}},
