{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=family|sex=f",{"My husband's checking the barn, we'll be right behind you","My husband's afraid of strangers, so I'll do the talking, hi","My husband says hello, he's too shy to say it himself"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=family|tmp=fresh",{"Are you okay? My little girl wants to know if you're okay","We're trying to get to Rosewood, is it safe? Is anything safe?","Please tell me you've got food, even a little, even crackers","I haven't slept, and I've got a baby, and I'm falling apart, hi","Did you see anyone out there? A man with a limp? My brother","I can't believe we're just walking, like it's normal","Are we safe here? Please, I don't know what to do anymore","Look, kids, other people, it's okay, it's okay"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=family|tmp=seasoned",{"We learned to keep the kids quiet, so, they're not rude, just trained","Our oldest is thirteen, and she's already a better shot than me","Don't let the kids touch anything, it's all dirty, I'm sorry","We've got a cow, can you believe it? A cow, in town","We've done this a hundred times, the kids know the drill","Whatever you do, don't let the kids drink from the creek","We trade eggs for bullets, it's a good deal for everyone","My oldest keeps watch, and I keep the count","Don't let the little one near the water, it's been bad lately"}},
