{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=warm",{"Good to see you, you made it through, I'm so glad","You two look like family, and that makes me happy","Hello, friends, I'm glad you're here, truly","You're still smiling, that's something"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=sad",{"Hello, I'm not myself today, sorry","I lost someone this week, so, if I'm quiet","Hi, nice to see people, I just can't talk"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=funny",{"Hey, you're either lost or going somewhere interesting, which is it?","You two look like you're headed to a party, hope there's cake","If you see my sanity, tell it to come home","Good day for a picnic, just don't open the basket"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=grim",{"Don't look back there, trust your gut","Another day, another dozen, hello"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=fear",{"Is that you? Oh, thank God, it's you","Don't startle me like that, I'm barely holding it together","Wait! Are you real? Say something!"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|mood=angry",{"What do you want? I'm sorry, long day, hi","Don't say a word about my hair, it's been a week"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Hey, hey","Hi","Hello, hello","Well, well","Oh","Yes?","Sorry","Here we go","Ah, good","Easy","There you are","Welcome","I'd stop and talk, but the baby's asleep and the wagon's falling apart. If I sit down I'm not getting up","Hey","Hi there","Hello","Hey, you","Howdy","Y'all okay?","You good?","Doing alright?","Any news?","Where to?","Nice to see you","You're up and about","Careful, hon","Easy, now","Take it slow","Go on ahead","After you","Sorry, excuse us","Pardon us","Mind your head","Watch your footing","Y'all heading in?","Headed far?","Seen anyone?","Anybody back there?","Anything out front?","All quiet?","Hanging in there?","Hello, neighbor","Any food?","Any water?","Sorry, we're in a hurry","You alright, hon?","Keep on, we're fine","God willing, we'll see you","See you around","Well, there you are","Didn't expect company","Hello, neighbors","Well, hello","Ah, there","Hi, hi","Hey, you two","Easy there","Hush now","Over here","Wait up","Right behind you","Sorry about that","Oh, there you are","We used to have a block party every Fourth. I can't find half those people now","My daughter keeps asking when we're going home. I keep saying soon, and she keeps looking at me","You see any infected on your way? We lost count of ours","Those things hate the sun, or I'm making that up, hello","Careful, the dead are slow, but they never stop, you know that","The infected don't like fire, so, we keep a little one going","Monsters, that's what the kids call 'em, I can't argue","Hey, if you're quiet, they don't notice, at least that's been our luck","We found one in the garage, and it took four of us","Don't let your little ones see them up close, it's not right","They've got a smell, you can tell before you see them","You heard the moaning earlier? I figured it was nothing","The Wilsons made it to Louisville, so they say, I hope it's true","My cousin heard from a trucker that the bridge is out at Fort Knox","Hey, the ice cream shop's got a freezer still working, supposedly, a rumor","Somebody's got a generator running on Third, I heard","Heard they hung a sign at the courthouse, a list of names, you should look","Bill Wallace's farm has a well, if you're passing, tell him I sent you","Did you hear the church bell? Somebody's ringing it, bless them","The mayor's gone, so they say, left in a helicopter, or so I heard","Everybody's talking about a train, that's coming to take us out, I don't believe it"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|world=road",{"I used to know everyone on this road by their dogs. Now I don't know anyone, or where the dogs went","I spent thirty years learning every back road in this county, and not one of them goes anywhere safe"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=5,13",{"Still kicking, I see","Nine days, you keeping count? I lost it at six","Anyone told you the Army's gone? It's just us","Hey, you made it through the week, good for you","Radio died Tuesday, so, you're my news","I haven't seen a soul in two days, so, hello","Got a plan? Because I'm all out","Everybody's moving, where's everybody going?"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=14,29",{"Two weeks, you believe it? Two weeks of this","Hello again, you're still around, I'm glad","We found a well, if you need water, it's behind the Baptist church","You trading? I've got socks, they're clean, mostly","Everybody I know is gone, so, you're my friends now, sorry","Do you remember what pizza tasted like? I'm losing it"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|day=30,9999",{"A month already, can you imagine","Don't ask what day it is, I've got no idea","You stayed alive this long, so you're smarter than most","Our garden's coming in, if you've got seeds, we'll swap","We're a little group, ten of us, there's room, if you need it","I stopped waiting for the Army, I started planting corn"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law,swat|day=5,9999",{"Still no word from the state, I'm guessing you've heard the same","Anybody else down to their last box of shells?","Nobody's replaced the dispatcher, because the dispatcher's dead","How many deputies you got left? We're at six"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=military,elite|day=5,9999",{"Nothing from command in a week, you?","Orders were hold, so we hold, what else is there","We're down to half rations, you?","No resupply, no relief, no clue"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|day=5,9999",{"Cops ain't coming back, you know that? Never","Funny how freedom feels a lot like boredom","Plenty of room now, nobody's in the way","Good, you're still alive, I owe you a smoke"}},
{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=law|hour=16,5",{"Who's on the roadblock tonight? Don't say me"}},
