{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=military|tmp=fresh",{"Uh, hey, sorry, is it okay to talk? I'm still learning the rules","I don't know what's going on, do you? Please say you do","Sarge, am I doing this right? I have no idea what I'm doing","Do I salute? Do we salute? Nobody told me"}},
