{"PASSING_NPC_GREET","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=0,4",{"Did you see those things? Did you? I can't be the only one!","Are they sick? Are they dead? Tell me, you must know","My uncle went out for groceries and came back like that, I can't","That was Mr. Jenkins, I'd know that coat anywhere, it was him","Who's in charge? Somebody has to be in charge!"}},
